WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.060 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 19]
[This story is purely fictional]

02:49.400 --> 02:50.610
Where are the pouches Jiu gave us?

02:51.750 --> 02:52.780
It's not time yet.

02:53.150 --> 02:53.940
We can't open them.

02:56.430 --> 02:57.450
Jiu

02:58.470 --> 03:00.410
guards against us like we're thieves.

03:02.100 --> 03:04.580
[Private Room One]

03:19.150 --> 03:21.540
President Tottori, what an honor

03:21.710 --> 03:23.010
to meet you today.

03:42.150 --> 03:43.290
Chief Editor Liang.

03:46.430 --> 03:47.340
Have you

03:47.840 --> 03:49.380
set your sights on any lots today?

03:50.680 --> 03:51.540
President Tottori,

03:52.590 --> 03:53.100
greetings.

03:53.560 --> 03:56.730
I'm Chen Minzhi, Deputy Chief Editor

03:57.150 --> 03:57.890
of Yahe Monthly.

03:58.960 --> 04:00.060
I've heard so much

04:00.400 --> 04:01.340
about you.

04:01.910 --> 04:03.940
With you here at today's auction,

04:04.190 --> 04:05.610
Chief Editor Liang and I

04:05.800 --> 04:07.170
feel much more assured.

04:07.800 --> 04:09.380
If you have any instructions,

04:09.710 --> 04:10.540
just say the word.

04:10.750 --> 04:12.450
We'll do everything in our power

04:12.840 --> 04:13.540
and won't be

04:14.400 --> 04:15.540
the slightest bit remiss.

04:17.750 --> 04:19.700
Yahe Monthly

04:21.240 --> 04:23.020
certainly has no shortage of talent.

04:26.390 --> 04:27.490
Editor Chen

04:28.040 --> 04:29.340
has devoted himself fully

04:29.800 --> 04:30.660
to our magazine.

04:31.160 --> 04:32.370
Since he rarely gets to come here,

04:32.630 --> 04:33.610
I brought him to broaden his horizons.

04:34.950 --> 04:35.580
By the way, sir,

04:36.040 --> 04:38.900
what are your plans for tonight?

04:40.750 --> 04:42.250
I hope you won't take offense.

04:42.830 --> 04:43.540
But this time,

04:44.040 --> 04:45.730
I've brought another expert,

04:45.920 --> 04:47.850
so my funds will have to be split between you.

04:48.600 --> 04:49.780
If someone is more qualified than I am,

04:50.070 --> 04:51.900
I'll gladly step aside.

04:52.160 --> 04:52.610
Good.

04:53.430 --> 04:53.900
Come.

04:54.830 --> 04:55.540
Allow me to introduce you.

04:56.430 --> 04:57.050
This

04:57.720 --> 05:00.220
is the adviser I've invited:

05:01.310 --> 05:02.610
Seventh Madam of the Mystic Nine,

05:03.560 --> 05:04.250
Miss Huo.

05:09.160 --> 05:09.980
Chief Editor Liang,

05:10.830 --> 05:11.410
a pleasure.

05:14.120 --> 05:15.850
You bear some resemblance

05:16.360 --> 05:17.580
to an old friend of mine.

05:19.560 --> 05:21.460
Then we must be destined to meet.

05:22.870 --> 05:23.460
All right.

05:23.830 --> 05:25.390
The auction is about to begin.

05:25.700 --> 05:27.780
Let me explain tonight's plan.

05:28.560 --> 05:30.850
I don't want our two private rooms

05:31.360 --> 05:32.700
competing directly

05:33.120 --> 05:34.290
and driving up each other's bids.

05:34.920 --> 05:36.100
That would benefit none of us.

05:37.430 --> 05:38.140
So,

05:38.800 --> 05:40.580
whenever we bid on an item,

05:41.120 --> 05:43.700
Chief Editor Liang, please don't bid.

05:44.120 --> 05:44.540
Understood.

05:45.070 --> 05:46.540
If we don't pursue a lot,

05:46.920 --> 05:49.340
you may use your own judgment

05:50.310 --> 05:51.370
and bid as you please.

05:54.800 --> 05:56.930
Look at the curtain outside our room.

05:57.000 --> 05:58.000
If a bouquet is pinned to it,

05:58.120 --> 05:59.290
that means we want the lot.

05:59.920 --> 06:00.700
If there isn't one,

06:02.240 --> 06:03.810
it's yours to pursue.

06:04.360 --> 06:04.810
Rest assured.

06:05.000 --> 06:05.810
We won't

06:05.830 --> 06:06.900
disrupt your plans, sir.

06:08.360 --> 06:09.050
I look forward to working with you.

06:10.070 --> 06:10.810
Likewise.

06:15.070 --> 06:16.020
We'll take our leave.

06:30.600 --> 06:31.140
What is it?

06:32.000 --> 06:33.980
Something about those two feels off.

06:35.630 --> 06:37.220
Instead of editors, they seem

06:37.800 --> 06:38.700
more like military officers.

06:39.560 --> 06:40.290
Once we see

06:40.680 --> 06:42.220
how they act at the auction,

06:42.270 --> 06:43.050
we'll know, won't we?

06:56.270 --> 06:57.370
Xiangu came here

06:57.560 --> 06:58.730
but didn't expose us.

06:59.680 --> 07:01.220
She must be here for Laogou.

07:01.560 --> 07:02.980
She'll probably help us.

07:04.390 --> 07:05.780
My concern is that besides Laogou,

07:07.000 --> 07:08.340
she may have more complicated motives.

07:08.940 --> 07:11.250
We can only adapt as things unfold.

07:12.510 --> 07:13.980
I trust the Mystic Nine know where to draw the line.

07:14.120 --> 07:15.100
Most of the Mystic Nine

07:15.510 --> 07:16.850
are here at Xinyue Restaurant.

07:17.600 --> 07:18.730
If something goes wrong,

07:19.480 --> 07:20.900
only two of the Mystic Nine will remain.

07:21.680 --> 07:24.220
Let's hope Chen Pi and Heibei behave themselves.

07:30.430 --> 07:31.370
It's about time.

07:31.600 --> 07:32.760
Take out the pouches.

07:39.670 --> 07:40.370
Give them to me.

07:41.190 --> 07:41.850
Jiu said to read

07:42.120 --> 07:43.170
the one with the large patterns first.

07:44.680 --> 07:46.020
What a nuisance.

07:55.750 --> 07:56.660
Can you even read it?

08:00.540 --> 08:02.500
[The key to securing what you want at an auction]

08:02.500 --> 08:03.800
[is whether anyone else]

08:03.800 --> 08:05.100
[wants the same item.]

08:07.950 --> 08:09.490
At Xinyue Restaurant auctions,

08:09.720 --> 08:10.540
most guests

08:10.920 --> 08:12.980
don't come with a particular item in mind.

08:13.430 --> 08:15.220
They're mostly wealthy people hunting for treasures.

08:16.480 --> 08:18.050
Before the artifact chests come up,

08:18.510 --> 08:19.540
we need someone

08:19.680 --> 08:21.540
to drive up the price of every earlier lot.

08:31.800 --> 08:32.890
Distinguished guests,

08:33.360 --> 08:34.670
the early session of the auction

08:34.670 --> 08:36.010
is about to begin.

08:37.480 --> 08:39.100
All unauthorized persons must leave.

08:40.200 --> 08:41.340
During the auction,

08:41.750 --> 08:43.370
please remain silent.

08:45.870 --> 08:47.700
We will now present the lots.

08:48.960 --> 08:51.100
The minimum bid increment is 5,000.

08:53.080 --> 08:55.530
Here is today's first lot.

08:57.030 --> 08:59.610
Isn't that a piece of Song Jun ware?

09:00.480 --> 09:02.240
Jun ware is said to rival jade

09:02.320 --> 09:03.660
and even surpass it in beauty.

09:04.030 --> 09:05.250
That rose-purple glaze

09:05.750 --> 09:07.600
is truly rare.

09:09.670 --> 09:12.110
Rare? What is this rubbish?

09:13.120 --> 09:15.580
A rose-red glazed apple-form vase.

09:16.120 --> 09:18.250
Its purple glaze is like clouds at dusk,

09:18.390 --> 09:19.770
its glow like the morning sky.

09:20.200 --> 09:22.650
It is among the finest surviving Song Jun pieces.

09:29.080 --> 09:29.820
Miss Huo,

09:30.510 --> 09:32.420
what do you think of this lot?

09:33.480 --> 09:34.530
The glaze is beautiful,

09:35.360 --> 09:36.370
but it was poorly fired.

09:40.480 --> 09:41.530
It certainly is no ordinary piece.

09:45.360 --> 09:47.730
Bidding begins!

09:48.630 --> 09:49.300
Ten thousand.

09:49.510 --> 09:51.980
Table 11 bids 10,000.

09:53.080 --> 09:53.820
Sixty thousand.

09:56.120 --> 09:59.060
Private Room Six bids 60,000!

10:04.510 --> 10:06.650
That's why we need two teams here.

10:07.200 --> 10:08.180
Chen Pi and Heibei,

10:08.720 --> 10:09.340
your task

10:09.390 --> 10:11.370
is to drive up the price of every lot.

10:12.200 --> 10:13.850
Everyone wants to enter the late session.

10:14.360 --> 10:16.100
They must spend enough...

10:16.350 --> 10:17.890
- Seventy thousand. - to win three lots.

10:18.440 --> 10:19.530
You need to make them believe...

10:19.600 --> 10:20.130
A hundred thousand.

10:20.150 --> 10:22.100
that entering tonight's late session will be difficult.

10:22.100 --> 10:23.890
Private Room Six bids 100,000!

10:25.000 --> 10:26.300
Any higher bids?

10:26.480 --> 10:27.300
Should we go higher?

10:38.790 --> 10:39.770
A hundred and five thousand!

10:40.870 --> 10:44.130
Table 11 bids 105,000.

10:46.510 --> 10:48.460
A hundred and five thousand, going once.

10:49.480 --> 10:51.530
A hundred and five thousand, going twice.

10:53.750 --> 10:55.890
A hundred and five thousand, third and final call.

10:57.960 --> 10:58.700
Sold!

10:59.270 --> 11:00.530
Congratulations to this guest

11:00.550 --> 11:02.700
on winning today's first lot.

11:02.960 --> 11:05.980
Let us congratulate our distinguished guests at Table 11!

11:07.980 --> 11:08.780
Congratulations.

11:13.740 --> 11:15.090
At such a high price.

11:18.600 --> 11:19.700
That wasn't difficult.

11:22.480 --> 11:23.940
Driving up the price isn't difficult.

11:24.750 --> 11:26.850
But Xinyue Restaurant is highly experienced.

11:27.000 --> 11:28.490
After we do this a few times,

11:28.750 --> 11:31.460
the other bidders and the restaurant

11:31.510 --> 11:33.980
will suspect we're planted bidders

11:34.030 --> 11:35.060
deliberately inflating prices.

11:35.120 --> 11:36.820
Then no one will follow our bids,

11:37.000 --> 11:38.250
and we'll be stuck paying for the lots ourselves.

11:38.550 --> 11:39.730
Didn't Jiu say

11:40.200 --> 11:41.650
we don't need to enter the late session?

11:41.910 --> 11:43.940
We just need to drain

11:44.150 --> 11:45.580
everyone else's money, don't we?

11:46.240 --> 11:47.250
I'll handle the next one.

11:47.910 --> 11:48.300
You...

11:49.630 --> 11:50.940
You didn't understand what I said at all.

12:04.030 --> 12:05.530
By the final stretch of the early session,

12:05.910 --> 12:07.370
you'll have drained everyone's funds.

12:08.080 --> 12:09.700
To conserve their money,

12:09.960 --> 12:11.220
no one will follow your bids.

12:12.120 --> 12:13.940
Master Zhang can then secure the final three lots

12:14.150 --> 12:15.610
at relatively low prices

12:15.840 --> 12:16.940
and keep more funds in reserve.

12:16.940 --> 12:22.140
[Beiping Branch of the Military Affairs Commission]

12:28.000 --> 12:28.700
Ladies and gentlemen,

12:29.390 --> 12:30.730
the early session has concluded.

12:31.390 --> 12:33.300
Those who have won three treasures,

12:33.630 --> 12:34.820
please rest for a while.

12:35.550 --> 12:36.530
After the Zi hour,
[*Zi hour: 11 PM to 1 AM]

12:36.530 --> 12:38.340
the late session will begin.

12:39.150 --> 12:41.700
All other guests, please leave at once.

12:51.670 --> 12:54.420
That private room kept driving up the prices.

12:55.240 --> 12:56.420
They seemed to be helping...

12:56.550 --> 12:57.300
I need to freshen up.

12:59.580 --> 13:03.060
[Private Room One]

13:05.630 --> 13:06.610
Get a telephone ready for me.

13:06.750 --> 13:07.100
Yes.

13:07.390 --> 13:09.010
There's something wrong with Liang Bencai.

13:17.910 --> 13:20.010
The prices today were outrageously high.

13:20.630 --> 13:21.300
What choice did we have?

13:21.750 --> 13:23.940
Without winning three lots, we couldn't enter the late session.

13:24.670 --> 13:27.280
That fellow in Private Room Five got his lots cheaply.

13:27.280 --> 13:28.370
Roast duck.

13:28.720 --> 13:29.940
Flaky Yunnan ham pastries.

13:30.550 --> 13:31.940
Braised shark fin with ginger and Sichuan pepper.

13:35.630 --> 13:36.250
One moment, please.

13:40.480 --> 13:40.850
Master Zhang,

13:41.390 --> 13:42.370
there's about one hour

13:42.390 --> 13:43.490
until the Zi hour.

13:44.200 --> 13:45.300
During the intermission,

13:45.510 --> 13:47.420
the guests in the private rooms will exchange toasts.

13:48.030 --> 13:50.010
It's our chance to learn about our rivals in the late session.

13:52.510 --> 13:54.700
We're posing as wartime collaborators.

13:55.320 --> 13:57.610
Won't that make mingling difficult?

13:58.550 --> 13:59.980
Your identity does make it inconvenient.

14:00.360 --> 14:02.420
I can handle this.

14:03.790 --> 14:04.770
Did you bring your calling cards?

14:04.960 --> 14:05.490
Yes.

14:06.600 --> 14:07.490
Be careful.

14:19.150 --> 14:20.100
Gentlemen,

14:20.480 --> 14:22.240
this fruit platter is compliments of the restaurant.

14:22.960 --> 14:24.130
Please enjoy.

14:27.510 --> 14:28.300
Chief Editor Liang,

14:29.000 --> 14:30.340
Miss Yin says

14:30.550 --> 14:31.850
there are several details

14:32.030 --> 14:35.250
about tonight's auction she must discuss with you in person.

14:35.870 --> 14:38.060
Please join her in the reception room.

14:39.600 --> 14:40.730
I'll go at once.

14:42.390 --> 14:44.060
Editor Chen, I'll leave things here to you...

14:44.150 --> 14:44.770
Go ahead.

14:54.200 --> 14:54.770
One more thing.

14:55.510 --> 14:56.460
Mr. Yin has said

14:56.600 --> 14:58.370
that during the intermission,

14:58.550 --> 15:00.010
the guests are free to mingle,

15:00.510 --> 15:01.700
so unless something urgent arises,

15:01.750 --> 15:02.730
there's no need to report it.

15:03.840 --> 15:04.700
And don't disturb him.

15:05.000 --> 15:05.490
Understood.

15:17.120 --> 15:18.700
Hello. Where would you like to be connected?

15:18.870 --> 15:19.610
Connect me

15:19.750 --> 15:20.890
to Yahe Monthly.

15:22.510 --> 15:23.460
Certainly. One moment, please.

15:29.840 --> 15:30.180
Sir,

15:30.790 --> 15:31.250
we're connected.

15:34.750 --> 15:35.130
Hello.

15:35.440 --> 15:36.600
- Hello. - Who are you calling for?

15:36.670 --> 15:38.470
This is Soichi Kishimoto of the Beiping Office

15:38.670 --> 15:40.420
of the Eastern Cultural Affairs Association.

15:41.240 --> 15:42.890
Mr. Kishimoto, what can I do for you?

15:43.510 --> 15:44.820
Where is Chief Editor Liang?

15:45.390 --> 15:47.730
He's attending the Military Affairs Commission's auction.

15:51.390 --> 15:52.060
May I ask

15:52.440 --> 15:54.100
what Mr. Liang Bencai looks like?

15:54.510 --> 15:55.650
Any distinguishing features?

15:56.840 --> 15:58.650
Chief Editor Liang is fair-skinned and slim.

15:59.200 --> 16:01.580
He's in his early thirties and wears round-framed glasses,

16:01.910 --> 16:02.650
with the air of a scholar.

16:03.080 --> 16:04.180
He's fairly tall.

16:04.870 --> 16:06.890
He always keeps his hair carefully combed

16:07.670 --> 16:08.460
and wears a long gown.

16:08.600 --> 16:09.220
He looks very refined.

16:10.000 --> 16:10.850
That's all.

16:22.670 --> 16:24.580
All of that is useless.

16:25.120 --> 16:26.340
From that description,

16:26.550 --> 16:28.490
we can't possibly tell whether he's Liang Bencai.

16:32.630 --> 16:34.250
Find someone who knows Liang Bencai

16:34.440 --> 16:35.610
and bring him to Xinyue Restaurant.

16:35.870 --> 16:36.820
Seat him in the main hall.

16:37.320 --> 16:37.650
Yes.

17:12.680 --> 17:13.250
Miss Huo,

17:16.480 --> 17:17.660
Mr. Yin of Xinyue Restaurant

17:17.830 --> 17:18.770
would like to invite you for tea.

17:19.880 --> 17:20.980
May I decline?

17:21.510 --> 17:22.490
Of course.

17:24.110 --> 17:24.700
However,

17:25.270 --> 17:25.810
Miss Huo,

17:26.830 --> 17:28.290
of all the guests here today,

17:28.880 --> 17:30.290
our boss has invited only you.

17:30.720 --> 17:32.660
Aren't you curious why?

17:37.790 --> 17:39.290
It'll only take as long as a cup of tea.

18:11.110 --> 18:11.660
Mr. Yin.

18:12.750 --> 18:13.180
Please come in.

18:22.540 --> 18:25.300
[Mr. Yin]

18:29.160 --> 18:30.770
Miss Huo, I've been waiting for you.

18:32.350 --> 18:32.730
Please sit.

18:44.590 --> 18:46.660
You're famously elusive, Mr. Yin.

18:47.830 --> 18:49.660
Yet today, you asked to see me.

18:50.640 --> 18:52.090
May I ask why?

18:52.550 --> 18:53.860
I invited you here to thank you.

18:55.160 --> 18:56.570
Thanks to the information you provided,

18:56.830 --> 18:57.940
not long ago,

18:58.680 --> 18:59.940
we acquired a collection of antiques.

19:00.270 --> 19:01.460
The partnership between Xinyue Restaurant

19:01.480 --> 19:02.660
and the Mystic Nine

19:02.680 --> 19:03.900
usually involves the Mystic Nine acquiring antiques

19:04.110 --> 19:05.380
and bringing them here for auction.

19:05.550 --> 19:06.900
But this time it was different.

19:08.160 --> 19:09.900
You provided the leads yourself.

19:11.440 --> 19:12.250
Therefore,

19:13.790 --> 19:14.660
this 200,000

19:16.030 --> 19:17.660
is the reward you are owed.

19:18.240 --> 19:19.380
Please accept it.

19:27.620 --> 19:29.700
[Two hundred thousand yuan]

19:31.830 --> 19:32.770
Thank you, Mr. Yin.

19:34.160 --> 19:34.940
Wait, Miss Huo.

19:36.960 --> 19:38.140
You haven't had your tea yet.

19:40.920 --> 19:42.180
I'd also like to ask

19:43.640 --> 19:44.940
about Xiangxi.

19:46.200 --> 19:47.140
Mr. Yin,

19:48.590 --> 19:50.180
you don't seem like the type to be concerned about the source of the goods.

19:51.350 --> 19:53.860
My daughter has ties to the Mystic Nine.

19:54.720 --> 19:56.620
There are certain things I must know.

19:58.720 --> 20:00.420
This matter concerns me alone.

20:01.070 --> 20:02.050
It has nothing to do with the Mystic Nine.

20:02.880 --> 20:04.900
You're asking the wrong question, sir.

20:06.550 --> 20:08.250
What exactly is in Xiangxi?

20:10.960 --> 20:12.180
That's all the information I have.

20:13.070 --> 20:15.250
The Mystic Nine plans to win those two artifact chests.

20:16.640 --> 20:17.220
Am I right?

20:17.720 --> 20:19.140
You knew about my plan all along?

20:21.310 --> 20:23.250
Then why didn't you stop it?

20:24.070 --> 20:25.220
I'm a businessman.

20:26.550 --> 20:27.700
I'm interested only in results.

20:28.510 --> 20:30.900
Quality goods benefit Xinyue Restaurant.

20:32.640 --> 20:34.250
But right now, what I truly want to know

20:34.270 --> 20:34.860
is

20:36.750 --> 20:37.900
what sort of person you are.

20:43.110 --> 20:45.180
The person hardest to understand is often oneself.

20:46.160 --> 20:46.770
Perhaps

20:48.960 --> 20:51.050
none of us has ever truly understood who we are.

20:52.440 --> 20:54.250
I can't tell you the whole story.

20:54.830 --> 20:57.090
I doubt you would care anyway.

20:58.400 --> 20:59.420
All I can say

21:00.200 --> 21:01.530
is that I did it to save someone.

21:04.030 --> 21:06.530
Then why did you come with the Japanese?

21:11.310 --> 21:12.420
Because this time,

21:14.350 --> 21:15.620
I'm trying to save myself.

21:17.070 --> 21:18.770
It seems you and those around you

21:18.790 --> 21:20.010
are in a great deal of trouble.

21:21.160 --> 21:22.570
Even with danger on every side,

21:23.550 --> 21:25.770
you still dared to use Xinyue Restaurant to lay your trap.

21:27.920 --> 21:28.980
That takes courage.

21:32.830 --> 21:34.050
I simply don't want to be

21:34.480 --> 21:35.660
swept along by events anymore.

21:36.000 --> 21:38.330
Then you can take control of the situation.

21:42.590 --> 21:43.860
I once thought so too.

21:45.590 --> 21:47.420
I believed that if I took control of everything,

21:48.920 --> 21:51.010
I could set it all back on the right course.

21:51.680 --> 21:53.220
But what happened afterward

21:53.240 --> 21:54.140
made me realize

21:55.680 --> 21:56.570
that sometimes, the fault

21:58.510 --> 21:59.530
lies beyond any one person.

22:01.400 --> 22:03.380
Perhaps for any person,

22:04.350 --> 22:05.420
the most important thing in life

22:05.440 --> 22:07.220
is choosing the right path.

22:08.680 --> 22:10.250
Only by following such a path

22:10.880 --> 22:12.220
can one avoid losing oneself.

22:18.640 --> 22:19.910
I understand

22:19.960 --> 22:20.920
everything you just said.

22:24.880 --> 22:25.670
Thank you.

22:26.920 --> 22:28.140
Those two artifact chests

22:29.720 --> 22:30.860
are the key, aren't they?

22:34.640 --> 22:36.940
They contain only two ancient corpses.

22:38.110 --> 22:39.570
What do the Mystic Nine want with them?

22:41.830 --> 22:43.250
Perhaps we won't know the reason

22:44.000 --> 22:45.140
until we see them for ourselves.

22:46.400 --> 22:47.570
For something this important,

22:47.680 --> 22:49.050
is Zhang Qishan here?

22:49.510 --> 22:50.290
If he is,

22:51.110 --> 22:52.940
I can only go against my daughter's wishes

22:53.680 --> 22:55.090
and have him beheaded on behalf

22:56.790 --> 22:57.730
of Xinyue Restaurant's shareholders

23:00.480 --> 23:01.330
to uphold the rules.

23:01.920 --> 23:03.490
If you truly wanted him dead, Mr. Yin,

23:04.270 --> 23:05.290
wouldn't you need only

23:06.240 --> 23:07.220
to step outside?

23:07.240 --> 23:08.620
Then he'd have nowhere to hide.

23:11.640 --> 23:12.940
All I can do now

23:14.270 --> 23:15.220
is stay inside.

23:16.110 --> 23:16.860
As long as I don't go out,

23:17.000 --> 23:18.180
whether he's here

23:18.350 --> 23:19.660
and whether he respects Xinyue Restaurant

23:21.350 --> 23:22.700
can never be proven.

23:23.590 --> 23:25.330
There are some other things

23:25.440 --> 23:26.770
I want to tell you.

23:27.960 --> 23:29.090
In one of the second-floor private rooms

23:29.680 --> 23:31.770
is someone behind Xinyue Restaurant.

23:34.030 --> 23:34.900
Xinyue Restaurant

23:36.310 --> 23:37.860
has someone else behind it?

23:38.920 --> 23:39.490
It does.

23:40.440 --> 23:41.980
I can't tell you who.

23:43.480 --> 23:46.330
But anyone capable of controlling Xinyue Restaurant from the shadows

23:47.400 --> 23:48.380
is no ordinary person.

23:51.550 --> 23:53.420
You do care about your son-in-law, Mr. Yin.

23:54.160 --> 23:55.900
Even if I wanted to protect him today,

23:56.270 --> 23:56.940
it'd be difficult.

23:58.350 --> 23:59.090
Miss Huo,

23:59.160 --> 24:00.570
if you can read between the lines,

24:01.510 --> 24:03.180
you'll understand what I mean.

24:06.380 --> 24:07.200
[Dong Nianxia]

24:07.200 --> 24:08.820
[Daughter of Xiamen's Shipping Magnate]
They may appear graceful and refined,

24:09.400 --> 24:10.690
mysterious and unfathomable,

24:11.940 --> 24:13.880
[Tian Zuocheng, Beiping's Opium King]

24:13.880 --> 24:15.180
crazed and jester-like,

24:16.760 --> 24:18.090
[Sun Shaoqin, son of Mr. Yin's friend]
or carefree and unruly,

24:19.110 --> 24:20.940
but these may all be masks.

24:21.480 --> 24:23.620
They've come to see whether Xinyue Restaurant's rules

24:24.000 --> 24:24.900
still stand

24:25.880 --> 24:27.570
and whether I've upheld them well.

24:28.750 --> 24:30.530
If they are displeased,

24:31.480 --> 24:32.940
I won't live through the night either.

24:49.880 --> 24:51.730
Tell me. Did you miss me?

24:58.240 --> 24:59.620
Don't worry.

25:00.510 --> 25:01.570
My husband

25:02.070 --> 25:04.380
won't appear at Xinyue Restaurant tonight.

25:08.750 --> 25:10.530
Aren't you afraid Mr. Yin will find out?

25:11.160 --> 25:12.220
So what if he does?

25:13.240 --> 25:15.620
I'm the young mistress of Xinyue Restaurant.

25:16.000 --> 25:18.490
He can't stop me from having an affair.

25:19.200 --> 25:20.490
How many lovers do you need, then?

25:25.720 --> 25:26.380
Only you.

25:28.750 --> 25:29.180
Come here.

25:32.310 --> 25:33.330
Come.

25:53.510 --> 25:54.620
I got this for you:

25:55.750 --> 25:58.290
the auction participants' proof-of-funds records.

26:03.510 --> 26:04.830
[Auction Participants' Proof of Funds]
One of them

26:04.880 --> 26:06.330
is someone behind Xinyue Restaurant,

26:06.680 --> 26:07.770
someone even my father wouldn't dare offend.

26:16.310 --> 26:16.860
Miss Huo,

26:18.030 --> 26:18.290
sit.

26:18.590 --> 26:19.290
Have something to eat.

26:25.720 --> 26:25.980
Here.

26:27.720 --> 26:28.250
Try some.

26:35.720 --> 26:37.220
President Tottori, you should know

26:37.640 --> 26:39.180
that my condition forbids meat and fish,

26:39.640 --> 26:40.700
especially seafood.

26:44.440 --> 26:45.140
Black Plague

26:46.550 --> 26:48.010
is caused by an immune system disorder.

26:48.480 --> 26:50.090
Consuming large amounts of protein

26:50.510 --> 26:53.090
can indeed trigger a toxic reaction in the body.

26:53.590 --> 26:54.570
For anyone else,

26:55.510 --> 26:57.140
eating this would be digging their own grave.

26:59.070 --> 27:00.140
But you're different.

27:01.160 --> 27:01.700
I have

27:02.240 --> 27:03.220
plenty of medicine.

27:04.590 --> 27:05.620
As long as you

27:05.880 --> 27:08.250
do your job as my adviser at this auction,

27:09.350 --> 27:10.620
you may eat as much as you like.

27:14.750 --> 27:15.180
Here.

27:15.750 --> 27:16.330
Try some.

27:33.110 --> 27:34.420
Thank you, President Tottori.

27:50.830 --> 27:52.180
The late session is about to begin.

27:52.440 --> 27:53.420
I should go make preparations.

27:53.440 --> 27:53.900
No.

27:55.200 --> 27:56.090
I'll send word

27:56.400 --> 27:57.490
and have them start later.

28:03.310 --> 28:04.330
All right.

28:04.640 --> 28:05.620
I'm only teasing you.

28:06.550 --> 28:07.250
Business comes first.

28:07.590 --> 28:08.220
Go on.

28:10.160 --> 28:11.220
And be very careful.

28:11.510 --> 28:12.460
As soon as the auction ends,

28:12.750 --> 28:13.700
I'll come straight back to you.

28:14.200 --> 28:15.660
What about your deputy chief editor?

28:16.240 --> 28:18.140
I'll have to leave him behind.

28:19.350 --> 28:20.220
Then I'll wait here

28:20.680 --> 28:22.090
for my Chief Editor Liang

28:22.440 --> 28:23.380
to return in triumph.

28:55.070 --> 28:55.620
Stop.

29:01.310 --> 29:02.570
Liang Bencai.

29:04.070 --> 29:05.810
Officer Tottori says he finds you suspicious.

29:08.070 --> 29:09.490
What did you do to offend him?

29:09.510 --> 29:10.290
He sent me to find you.

29:22.400 --> 29:23.490
Yamamoto...

29:54.880 --> 29:55.730
Liang Bencai,

29:56.070 --> 29:56.980
you've gone too far!

29:57.310 --> 29:59.250
How dare you bring a drunk into my room?

30:00.270 --> 30:01.980
We're through.

30:02.790 --> 30:04.770
You'll never set foot in my room again.

30:05.160 --> 30:05.900
Get out!

30:07.030 --> 30:07.730
Miss Yin,

30:08.030 --> 30:09.140
are you all right?

30:09.270 --> 30:10.180
What are you doing here?

30:11.160 --> 30:12.420
This is my private affair.

30:13.110 --> 30:14.290
How dare you interfere?

30:14.640 --> 30:15.330
Get out!

30:15.880 --> 30:16.380
Yes.

30:43.830 --> 30:44.420
What happened?

30:44.880 --> 30:45.490
He's dead.

30:45.830 --> 30:48.290
He said Tottori sent him to find Liang Bencai.

30:48.880 --> 30:50.380
They must have realized something was wrong with us.

30:51.310 --> 30:51.900
Master Zhang...

30:52.240 --> 30:52.860
It was an accident.

30:56.790 --> 30:58.530
Do you think Torii Tottori

30:58.590 --> 30:59.250
has met him before?

31:00.110 --> 31:01.770
Tottori isn't usually stationed in Beiping.

31:02.960 --> 31:03.620
It's hard to say.

31:08.160 --> 31:09.290
Doesn't this Sasaki

31:09.830 --> 31:11.330
remind you of someone?

31:22.440 --> 31:23.220
President Tottori,

31:24.400 --> 31:25.250
Mr. Sasaki is here.

31:25.880 --> 31:27.090
He said you summoned him,

31:27.830 --> 31:28.730
but

31:29.480 --> 31:30.770
he's extremely drunk.

31:31.790 --> 31:33.250
I simply couldn't reason with him.

31:34.270 --> 31:35.090
Where is he?

31:35.920 --> 31:36.700
I'll take you to him.

31:50.070 --> 31:50.490
Sasaki,

31:51.160 --> 31:51.530
wake up.

31:52.830 --> 31:53.290
Sasaki?

31:55.000 --> 31:55.620
Sasaki,

31:55.680 --> 31:56.180
wake up.

31:56.790 --> 31:57.330
This way.

31:59.000 --> 31:59.420
President Tottori.

32:13.720 --> 32:14.250
Sasaki!

32:26.880 --> 32:29.660
When he wakes, tell him to go back to the garrison

32:29.790 --> 32:31.050
to report for punishment.

32:31.830 --> 32:32.180
Yes.

33:17.240 --> 33:18.770
Let go!

33:19.110 --> 33:20.220
Let go, you fool!

33:21.240 --> 33:22.220
Let go!

33:22.790 --> 33:23.620
Let go!

33:25.480 --> 33:26.220
My apologies.

33:26.270 --> 33:26.730
Forgive his behavior.

33:27.720 --> 33:29.490
What a disgrace to the Empire of Japan!

33:32.240 --> 33:32.730
I'm sorry.

33:42.440 --> 33:43.090
He's gone.

33:45.310 --> 33:45.860
Gone?

33:54.480 --> 33:56.460
What a waste of such good wine.

34:11.570 --> 34:12.980
They do look somewhat alike.

34:13.230 --> 34:15.380
No wonder Chen Pi always gets on my nerves.

34:20.630 --> 34:22.900
A great many unexpected things

34:23.320 --> 34:25.530
have happened during this one-hour intermission.

34:26.030 --> 34:27.260
Did you notice

34:27.590 --> 34:29.460
anyone unusual in the private rooms?

34:29.460 --> 34:30.590
[Private Room Three]

34:30.590 --> 34:32.340
I'm Chen Minzhi

34:32.590 --> 34:33.530
of Yahe Monthly.

34:34.400 --> 34:35.340
Sorry to disturb you.

34:42.150 --> 34:43.380
It's you?

34:46.280 --> 34:47.340
I never expected

34:47.920 --> 34:49.380
to meet an old acquaintance here.

35:04.280 --> 35:05.380
I just took my medicine.

35:07.280 --> 35:08.740
What happened earlier

35:09.320 --> 35:10.860
put me somewhat on edge.

35:12.070 --> 35:13.210
I'll be fine soon.

35:15.030 --> 35:17.170
Can you really not quit morphine?

35:19.110 --> 35:19.900
Without it,

35:21.360 --> 35:22.530
I can't think.

35:25.190 --> 35:26.420
You should get some rest.

35:55.510 --> 35:56.380
Gentlemen,

35:56.920 --> 35:58.980
you won only one lot in the early session.

35:59.230 --> 36:00.650
According to Xinyue Restaurant's rules,

36:00.920 --> 36:02.820
you cannot participate in the late session.

36:02.880 --> 36:03.530
What?

36:04.670 --> 36:06.420
We can't enter the late session after winning only one lot?

36:06.420 --> 36:07.570
Who made such an absurd rule?

36:08.070 --> 36:09.740
None of you ever told us about it.

36:11.030 --> 36:12.570
My boss paid a fortune

36:12.590 --> 36:13.610
for this private room.

36:13.840 --> 36:15.210
We were promised it for the entire auction.

36:15.400 --> 36:17.050
Now you're throwing us out halfway through?

36:17.550 --> 36:18.530
How is that fair?

36:19.510 --> 36:20.340
Look at this.

36:20.590 --> 36:22.090
We saved all this money

36:22.190 --> 36:23.170
for the late session.

36:23.230 --> 36:24.260
Please don't be angry.

36:24.360 --> 36:25.380
I haven't finished.

36:26.190 --> 36:27.940
You're honored guests from the early session

36:28.190 --> 36:29.010
who paid a substantial sum.

36:29.550 --> 36:32.130
You may move to the main hall

36:32.590 --> 36:34.570
and continue watching the late session,

36:35.110 --> 36:36.980
but you may no longer bid.

36:37.110 --> 36:38.820
Are you humiliating my boss?

36:39.360 --> 36:40.780
You're throwing us out of here?

36:41.110 --> 36:42.490
My boss can't afford such disgrace.

36:43.000 --> 36:43.860
We're not going.

36:46.800 --> 36:48.210
We came here to make a name for ourselves.

36:48.590 --> 36:50.980
A seat in some corner downstairs

36:51.960 --> 36:52.980
might be acceptable.

36:53.440 --> 36:54.380
- But... - Gentlemen,

36:54.670 --> 36:55.650
my sincere apologies.

36:55.960 --> 36:56.780
I'll arrange it at once.

37:12.760 --> 37:13.780
Give the guests from Private Room Six

37:13.880 --> 37:14.940
a conspicuous table.

37:15.280 --> 37:16.420
We don't know who they are.

37:16.630 --> 37:17.650
If they're out of sight,

37:18.030 --> 37:18.980
there may be trouble.

37:39.230 --> 37:40.090
Ladies and gentlemen,

37:40.630 --> 37:44.130
the late session will now officially begin.

37:45.840 --> 37:47.900
There are ten lots in this session,

37:48.190 --> 37:49.820
[Featured Highlights]
all exceptional treasures.

37:50.400 --> 37:52.300
The minimum bid increment

37:52.320 --> 37:53.900
is 10,000 silver coins,

37:54.190 --> 37:55.820
with no upper limit.

37:58.440 --> 38:01.170
Our first lot is a Han dynasty

38:02.110 --> 38:03.940
recumbent jade ram.

38:14.190 --> 38:14.900
Ladies and gentlemen,

38:15.590 --> 38:17.460
bidding begins now.

38:18.030 --> 38:18.650
Fifty thousand.

38:19.150 --> 38:21.210
Table 11 bids 50,000.

38:22.710 --> 38:23.380
Sixty thousand.

38:23.670 --> 38:25.340
Table 10 bids 60,000.

38:25.510 --> 38:26.170
Eighty thousand.

38:26.800 --> 38:28.740
Private Room Seven bids 80,000.

38:29.230 --> 38:29.940
One hundred and ten thousand.

38:30.110 --> 38:32.090
Table 14 bids 110,000.

38:32.360 --> 38:33.050
One hundred and twenty thousand.

38:33.280 --> 38:34.130
One hundred and fifty thousand!

38:34.550 --> 38:35.260
Two hundred thousand!

38:39.180 --> 38:45.180
[Magical Artifact Chests]

39:01.740 --> 39:05.900
♪The past fades like smoke♪

39:06.260 --> 39:08.980
♪A choice is made in silence♪

39:09.260 --> 39:12.060
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

39:12.460 --> 39:16.220
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

39:16.460 --> 39:19.900
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

39:20.180 --> 39:23.580
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

39:23.660 --> 39:30.940
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

39:31.380 --> 39:34.660
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

39:34.940 --> 39:38.180
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

39:38.340 --> 39:42.380
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

39:42.580 --> 39:45.940
♪Who believes in fate?♪

39:46.180 --> 39:49.540
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

39:49.780 --> 39:53.060
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

39:53.380 --> 39:57.060
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

39:57.260 --> 40:00.500
♪Take care♪

40:00.500 --> 40:03.060
♪We once raced♪

40:03.140 --> 40:05.060
♪For the dawn♪

40:05.220 --> 40:08.500
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

40:08.620 --> 40:11.900
♪In the web of fate♪

40:11.900 --> 40:15.100
♪No one can escape♪

40:16.100 --> 40:17.940
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

40:18.100 --> 40:19.660
♪We too were young once♪

40:19.740 --> 40:23.180
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

40:23.380 --> 40:25.700
♪Keep the ember lit♪

40:25.820 --> 40:30.340
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

40:30.460 --> 40:33.420
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

40:33.660 --> 40:37.180
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

40:37.300 --> 40:41.060
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

40:41.380 --> 40:44.860
♪Who believes in fate?♪

40:45.020 --> 40:48.020
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

40:48.260 --> 40:52.020
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

40:52.180 --> 40:55.900
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

40:56.020 --> 41:07.460
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
